{"id":55629,"ord":81,"n_segments":90,"prev":55628,"next":55630,"doc":{"id":"68090","title":"68090_Ed Garland oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Ed Garland","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/68090/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=68090"},"chapter":"Tastes, other bassists and advice","title":"Music he listens to: Ellington, the Dorseys, Guy Lombardo, Les Brown","category":"reflections","summary":"Garland likes Ellington, the Dorseys, Lombardo and Les Brown.","period":null,"year_from":null,"year_to":null,"words":192,"start":[121,7],"end":[123,4],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=68090#s55629","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Stockton","focus":0,"type":"city"}],"venues":[],"bands":[{"name":"Duke Ellington Orchestra","focus":1,"leader":"Duke Ellington"},{"name":"Dorsey Brothers Orchestra","focus":1,"leader":null},{"name":"Guy Lombardo Orchestra","focus":1,"leader":"Guy Lombardo"},{"name":"Les Brown Orchestra","focus":1,"leader":"Les Brown"}]},"people":[{"name":"Guy Lombardo","qid":"Q467087","n":5},{"name":"Les Brown","qid":"Q353587","n":4},{"name":"Louis Armstrong","qid":"Q1779","n":2},{"name":"Dorsey","qid":null,"n":2},{"name":"Duke Ellington","qid":"Q4030","n":1},{"name":"Clyde","qid":null,"n":1}],"story":{"theme":50,"theme_name":"Where jazz stands today: young players, rock, and the audience","community":44,"community_name":"Listening to classical music, then and now","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":121,"b":7,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"That's lovely. I like that. Ah, What other music -- what other kinds of music have you enjoyed? I wrote down, for example, did you enjoy hearing Duke Ellington? Did you enjoy --"},{"p":121,"b":8,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Hearing him?"},{"p":121,"b":9,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Yeah."},{"p":121,"b":10,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"I did."},{"p":121,"b":11,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"What other music do you listen to when you're on vacation and --"},{"p":121,"b":12,"s":"","x":"HEMLOCK"},{"p":122,"b":0,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"I enjoy listening to -- to ah, oh, those two brothers --"},{"p":122,"b":1,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Dorsey?"},{"p":122,"b":2,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Dorsey, yeah. And, I also crazy about Lombardi."},{"p":122,"b":3,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Oh, Clyde -- Guy Lombardo?"},{"p":122,"b":4,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Guy Lombardi."},{"p":122,"b":5,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":122,"b":6,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"I really love his playing. He's bad. And, the Brown -- Les Brown's band --"},{"p":122,"b":7,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":122,"b":8,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"I like Les Brown."},{"p":122,"b":9,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Oh, you know Les Brown's band."},{"p":122,"b":10,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"I played beside Les Brown's band in Sacra -- in Stockton. Was playing for a college down there and --"},{"p":122,"b":11,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":122,"b":12,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"On the same program together."},{"p":122,"b":13,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"It's interesting that you like Guy Lombardo. Armstrong always liked Guy Lombardo."},{"p":122,"b":14,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"I liked Guy --"},{"p":122,"b":15,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Many musicians just say Guy Lombardo is terrible, oh, that's cornball. --"},{"p":122,"b":16,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Oh, nothing."},{"p":122,"b":17,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"And Louie always --"},{"p":123,"b":0,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"He's still going."},{"p":123,"b":1,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"He is indeed, he's still going."},{"p":123,"b":2,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"He's still going."},{"p":123,"b":3,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Did they -- go ahead, go ahead."},{"p":123,"b":4,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Sweetest music this side of heaven."}]}